5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;-&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">성서홈플러스(</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서체\">용산역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 궁서체\">IC</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서체\">방향 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 궁서체\">30m </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서체\">지점) 8:40분 5대 운행</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2.23(화)하교 : 금오공대</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">→대구</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;- 학교 정문주차장에서 8:00출발 시민회관(6대), 성서홈플러스(5대)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 궁서체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 새굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 새굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Do